       "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2026 16:48:44 GMT+0000",
       "text": "<h1>COM Express &amp; SMARC Industrial Computer Modules and ARM-based SoMs</h1>\r\n<p>TQ Systems is a leading manufacturer and supplier of embedded computing solutions based on standard form factors such as COM Express®, COM-HPC Mini, and SMARC, as well as ARM®-based proprietary System-on-Modules (SoMs) and high-reliability connector-based modules. TQ Systems delivers the latest processor technologies as embedded modules, single board computers (SBCs), industrial PCs, modular solution platforms, and complete turnkey systems. All products are developed and manufactured in-house at TQ’s ISO 9001-certified production facilities, ensuring maximum quality, flexibility, and long-term availability. The company also offers a complete design service and support portfolio including BSP and driver support, custom BIOS options, obsolescence management, and vertical market expertise in Medical, Aerospace, Industrial Automation, Robotics, Energy, and Transportation.</p>\r\n",
       "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 26 2026 16:49:19 GMT+0000",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
