       "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
       "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2026 08:06:19 GMT+0000",
       "alt": "An TQ embedded module",
       "text": "<h1>Embedded Modules</h1>\r\n<p>Embedded processor technology has been our passion for more than 30 years. Whether x86, Arm® Module, QorIQ® Layerscape technology or Power Architecture®, we provide the latest processor technology in the form of embedded modules (single board computer), Industrial PCs, modular solution platforms and finished systems. Combining in-house development and production with our commitment to quality, durability, longevity and long-term availability, we make it possible for our customers to easily integrate embedded processors from leading manufacturers such as NXP, Texas Instruments and Intel into a wide variety of different applications.</p>\r\n",
       "displayPopupTitle": "true",
