       "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2026 08:23:01 GMT+0000",
       "alt": "Single board computers",
       "text": "<h1>Single Board Computers</h1>\r\n<p>Whether for industrial control, medical technology, or IoT - TQ’s Single Board Computers (SBCs) are precisely tailored to meet the demands of modern embedded applications. Based on our in-house developed embedded modules, they deliver maximum performance in a compact form factor - combined with a wide range of industry-grade interfaces and long-term availability by design.</p>\r\n",
