       "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
       "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 26 2026 08:26:26 GMT+0000",
       "alt": "Embedded BOX PCs",
       "text": "<h1>Box PCs</h1>\r\n<p>With the right equipment, you can implement the topic of Smart Manufacturing in the areas of production, assembly and testing in a targeted and efficient manner. In order to keep investment costs as low as possible, it is important to combine different functions and combine them in one device. For example, the display of production documents, the recording of production data and functions for quality inspection and logging can be combined in a single PC unit. The Box PCs from TQ provide a good basis for this and numerous other key functions.</p>\r\n",
